        "text": "I've been getting back into teaching kids programming. Of course, this time using Lua, L\u00d6VE and <https://akkartik.itch.io/carousel|Carousel>. After a couple of months, it occurred to me to collect all my little impromptu puzzles and exercises into a single app anyone can go through on their own schedule.\n\n<https://akkartik.name/carousel-cards.love|Carousel cards> (L\u00d6VE app, really just a zip file containing source code, 169KB)\n\nNowhere near done yet. But it has 50 little \"levels\", each taking between a few seconds and a minute. A full game/curriculum might need 2000 levels or something.",
