        "client_msg_id": "ccd457ea-617b-4d12-86da-322b66063548",
        "text": "Thanks both for the encouraging words! Here's a new version with some small fixes and now 108 levels: <https://akkartik.name/carousel-cards.love|carousel-cards.love>\n\nWhile I've tried to leave illegible what you're supposed to learn from any single screen/level/lesson, I can't deny I've had some goals. Here are the topics I've tried to cover (with additions in this version in bold):\n\n\u2022 numbers, math\n\u2022 print\n\u2022 variables\n\u2022 functions\n\u2022 drawing\n\u2022 colors\n\u2022 assignment/mutating variables (`x = x+1`)\n\u2022 callbacks (`car.draw`, etc.)\n\u2022 animation using `car.update`\n\u2022 `if`, `else`, `elseif`\n\u2022 operators `~=`, `<=`, `>=`\n\u2022 *loops*\n\u2022 *arrays*",
        "team": "T5TCAFTA9",
